  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Roughly chop peanuts. Place on a plate."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, trim, and thinly slice strawberries. Add to the plate with the peanuts, keeping them separate."
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel bananas and halve lengthwise. Divide between plates or bowls."
    },
    {
      "text": "Use an ice cream scoop or measuring cup to portion yogurt over the bananas, then top with sliced strawberries."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, sprinkle \"banana splits\" with peanuts and enjoy!"
